Package: printer-driver-nelko
Source: printer-driver-nelko
Version: 0.3.6
Section: text
Priority: optional
Architecture: all
Depends: cups, python3, python3-pil
Recommends: bluez, poppler-utils
Suggests: cups-bsd, system-config-printer
Maintainer: remote_codes pack <remote-codes@example.com>
Description: CUPS driver for Nelko P21 Bluetooth label printers
 Userspace CUPS backend (nelko://), filter (rastertonelko), and PPD/drv
 for Nelko P21 TSPL2 over RFCOMM channel 1.
 .
 Install this package as root once. An lpadmin user then creates a
 queue. Users allowed by the CUPS print policy (lp/lpr on Debian) print
 without root. The backend is mode 0700 and runs as root so job
 submitters do not need the bluetooth group.
